      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,2.2rem);font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.2">GST Filing Prep — SCN Replies & Appeals, Portal-Ready</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1rem;color:#a1a1aa;margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.75;max-width:700px">Filing a Show Cause Notice reply or a GST appeal means getting a stack of documents past the portal in the right shape: each file under 5MB, annexures labelled and numbered, and no more than the allowed number of attachments. Doing that by hand with a random compressor at 11pm before a deadline is how filings get missed. Pick your mode, add the documents, and this stamps annexure labels, merges them into the permitted file count, and compresses each under the limit — checking as it goes rather than leaving you to guess.</p>
      <p id="seo-direct-answer" style="font-size:0.95rem;color:#e4e4e7;background:#18181b;border-left:3px solid #60a5fa;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 28px;line-height:1.7;max-width:720px">The GST portal caps each uploaded document at 5MB and expects your annexures to be clearly labelled and in order, which is why filings get rejected at the last minute. This tool prepares the bundle for you: choose SCN Reply or Appeal, add your documents, stamp sequential annexure labels onto the pages, merge them into the allowed number of files, and auto-compress each one under 5MB without making the text unreadable. Free, no sign-up, and nothing is uploaded — the documents stay on your own machine.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:32px">
        <span style="background:#18181b;border:1px solid #27272a;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:0.78rem;color:#a1a1aa">&#x2713; 100% Free</span>
        <span style="background:#18181b;border:1px solid #27272a;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:0.78rem;color:#a1a1aa">&#x2713; No Watermark</span>
        <span style="background:#18181b;border:1px solid #27272a;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:0.78rem;color:#a1a1aa">&#x2713; No Sign-Up</span>
